Letterbox word lists (world/shared/words/words.ts)

Source: 12dicts release 6.0.2, compiled by Alan Beale.
Alan Beale explicitly released the 12dicts lists into the public domain and
asked that their use be acknowledged. This does not cover the 2of12inf list
or the 2+2+3 lists (those depend on AGID); Letterbox does not use them.

Lists used, all public domain:
- American/6of12.txt — answer words (in at least 6 of 12 dictionaries)
- American/2of12.txt, American/3esl.txt, Special/2of5core.txt
- International/2of4brif.txt, International/3of6all.txt, International/3of6game.txt, International/5d+2a.txt
  — the larger set of allowed guesses

Upstream: http://wordlist.aspell.net/12dicts/
Package: http://downloads.sourceforge.net/wordlist/12dicts-6.0.2.zip

No other word list is included. In particular the Google Web Trillion Word
Corpus frequency list is not used.
